<h3><u>Mera ghar jalaya</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span data-ft=""{""tn"":""K""}"" class=""userContent"">Ya husain ya husain ya husain<br> Husain....(3)<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Aabid bachawa ya ag bujhawa....(2)<br> Rowake zainab kis paas jawa<br> <span class=""text_exposed_show""><br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Yusuf te sone mere veer maare,Mai shaam chaliya be kafan saare....(2)<br> Qabra banawa ya rasiya paawaa...(2)<br> rowake zainab kis paas jawa<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Mai dee'n bachawad wich shaam ayi, sab log wekhad meri beridai...(2)<br> Khudbe sunawa ya mu lukawa...(2)<br> rowake zainab kis paas jawa.<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Zaine che qasim di laash aai, chum chum ke tukde kar zehra jaai...(2)<br> Pudse rilawa ya saf bichawa...(2)<br> rowake zainab kis paas jawa.<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Jis veer de lai chadya madina, jine qatl hoya bhulna kadhi na...(2)<br> onhu kafn paawa ya shaam jawaa(2)<br> rowake zainab kis paas jawa.<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Veera de qatil khaime che aagaye, ai hasan zainab aabid nu aakar(2)<br> Hud jal mai jaawa ya baher aawa...(2)<br> rowake zainab kis paas jawa.<br> <br> Mera ghar jalaya lutya ridawa rowake zainab kis paas jawa...(2)<br> <br> Ya husain ya husain ya husain<br> Husain....(3)</span></span></p>
               
